  <ButtonText>k__BackingField: "Je pense que tu t\u2019inqui\xE8te pour rien"
  <NpcText>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Oui sans doute ! Il n\u2019y a aucun risque, j\u2019ai tout nettoy\xE9 !\r\n"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 668c08530be223b44883e3880f11ee48, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Je vous assure que non, mais je vous aurais pr\xE9venu, il ne faudra pas venir
      se plaindre plus tard.\r\n"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Oh\u2026"
